This crate is a Rust/Burn port of the Core RP inference architecture, motion
representation, tokenizer, DDIM sampler and checkpoint conventions. It adds
bounded Burnpack artifact loading and native/browser transports. It is not
the upstream Python distribution. The upstream software license and its
third-party notice are retained in LICENSE.

Model weights are not included. ARDY weights have separate NVIDIA model
license terms. Optional Llama/LLM2Vec text encoders have their own licenses.
